releases. This repository holds no source code: only the signed APKs, their
SHA256SUMS and the signing certificate's fingerprint.

BASED ON
--------
Based on kickoff by Romain Nicod
(https://github.com/romain-nicod/kickoff), licensed under CC BY 4.0.
The Android app started from the Time-Task-Tick Android shell, by the same
author, and was adapted into a client of a Fan-Task-Tick server.

